+    // VOYO i8: the GC2235 front sensor tops out near 15 fps, but with a fixed AE
+    // range the vendor HAL holds it to 30 ms at low gain, so video comes out about
+    // 4x darker than photos. Open the range on video requests so its AE works.
+    if (mId == "1") {
